        href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/thomgillespie/">Thom Gillespie</a
      > and <a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://mediaschool.indiana.edu/people/profile.html?p=jurfox"
        >Dr. Julia Fox</a
      > if you need to.
    </p>
